{
  "content": "<h1 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryStandardCosts\">Inventory Standard Costs</h1>\n<p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryStandardCosts Settings\">The <strong>Inventory Standard Costs</strong> section, found within the <strong>Settings</strong> tab in Manager.io, enables you to update standard costs for your inventory items. This feature is essential for maintaining accurate costing information and ensuring your inventory valuations reflect the most current cost data.</p>\n<p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryStandardCosts Settings\"><div><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex space-x-2 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-2xl text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-2xl text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center space-x-2 rtl:space-x-reverse p-4\"><i class=\"text-3xl text-neutral-400 dark:text-slate-400 fas fa-fw fa-scanner-keyboard\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryStandardCosts\">InventoryStandardCosts</span></span></div></div></div></div></p>\n<h2 translate=\"true\">Creating a New Inventory Standard Cost</h2>\n<p translate=\"true\">To create a new inventory standard cost:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Settings\">Navigate to the <strong>Settings</strong> tab.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"InventoryStandardCosts\">Click on <strong>Inventory Standard Costs</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"NewInventoryRevaluation\">Click the <strong>New Inventory Revaluation</strong> button.</p>\n<p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"NewInventoryRevaluation\"><div><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:shadow-none flex space-x-4 rtl:space-x-reverse shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 dark:text-gray-400 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"InventoryStandardCosts\">InventoryStandardCosts</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewInventoryStandardCost\">NewInventoryStandardCost</span></span></div></div></div></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n",
  "key": "inventory-standard-costs"
}
